1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,263
More trades doesn't mean more profit.

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:08,212
Overtrading means jumping in and out on every little wiggle.

3
00:00:08,581 --> 00:00:12,907
Each trade has costs, and more trades means more chances to make a mistake.

4
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:20,060
The fix is fewer, better trades. Wait for your setup, size it properly, and be happy to skip a day.

5
00:00:20,409 --> 00:00:25,061
On Meme Street, the Daily Chart gives you one go a day, to practise being patient.

6
00:00:25,561 --> 00:00:28,992
Practise trading less, and better, at memestreet.net.

